  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider in designing an integrated approach to child and adolescent TB care include:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4376831054688,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "the existing infrastructure (e.g. baseline health infrastructure, need for expansion or upgrading); the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.41455078125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "applicable regulatory framework; financing; the choice between an operational research setting or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4212646484375,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "programmatic implementation; human resource issues (including staffing requirements and human",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4069213867188,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "resources development such as capacity-building/training and consultation skills); monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4091186523438,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "evaluation; qualitative research into community needs; perceptions (including views on stigma; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        130.46409606933594,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "suggestions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.47807312011719,
        168.18463134765625,
        527.441162109375,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "Differentiated service delivery (DSD):  DSD is a person-centred approach developed in the HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.4454345703125,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "programme that simplifies and adapts HIV services across the range of care in ways that both serve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.4002075195312,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "the needs of people living with and vulnerable to HIV and optimize the available resources in health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.3914184570312,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "systems. The principles of DSD can be applied to prevention, testing, linkage to care, ART initiation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.81874084472656,
        527.4125366210938,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "(162) and follow-up, as well as to the integration of HIV care, co-infections and co-morbidities  . This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4046630859375,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "approach is based on the principle that when families are given the choice to interact with the health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.49072265625,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "system, this provides a possible mechanism for integration of child and adolescent TB services within",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999500274658203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.455322265625,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "PHC or other programmes. Examples of implementing DSD for children and adolescents with or at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        326.666748046875,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "risk of TB are provided in WHO’s operational handbook.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.7119445800781,
        223.77130126953125,
        317.5639343261719
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.7718200683594,
        527.421142578125,
        339.21484375
      ],
      "text": "The move to decentralized, family-centred, integrated services requires careful planning and regular",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.9718933105469,
        527.4387817382812,
        352.4149169921875
      ],
      "text": "monitoring of implementation against the plan. The capacity needs of national TB programmes for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.17181396484375,
        436.20477294921875,
        365.6148376464844
      ],
      "text": "implementing the proposed interventions need to be identified and addressed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.87579345703125,
        527.1384887695312,
        387.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "Enhanced data collection on child and adolescent TB potentially takes a substantial amount of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.0758056640625,
        527.3959350585938,
        400.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "additional time, and detailed data collection may be feasible only in specific operational research",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.27581787109375,
        527.2335815429688,
        413.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "settings. Programmes generally have registers in place for contact investigation, treatment registration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967903137207031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.4757995605469,
        527.3773193359375,
        426.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "and outcomes, as well as TPT registers. The use of these (preferably electronic) tools is important for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.6758117675781,
        527.5455322265625,
        440.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "ensuring comprehensive management and treatment as programmes move to a more decentralized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990145683288574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.87579345703125,
        527.3902587890625,
        453.3188171386719
      ],
      "text": "and family-centred, integrated approach. The use of the tools should be evaluated and enhanced,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.0758056640625,
        254.28785705566406,
        466.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "including through operational research.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        473.7796936035156,
        527.454833984375,
        488.22271728515625
      ],
      "text": "It will be important to monitor the number of children diagnosed at different levels of the health system –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.9797058105469,
        527.2067260742188,
        501.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "including the proportion of children who have bacteriological confirmation, the proportion who were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988143920898438,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.1797180175781,
        527.4285888671875,
        514.6227416992188
      ],
      "text": "clinically diagnosed and the number of children initiated on and completing TPT. Disaggregation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.3796997070312,
        527.3761596679688,
        527.8226928710938
      ],
      "text": "of data by sex will be important to evaluate the impact on gender equity. Evaluating the quality of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.5797119140625,
        527.4299926757812,
        541.022705078125
      ],
      "text": "services (covering the quality of all steps in the patient pathway, from screening to diagnosis and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.7796630859375,
        398.0886535644531,
        554.22265625
      ],
      "text": "treatment) as well as client satisfaction are also important components.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "198 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
